BadWolfQuiz Monetization Restriction and Commercial-Use Exception

The following terms are an additional license clarification and exception
provided by the Licensor specifically for BadWolfQuiz. If these terms conflict
with the Commons Clause definition of "Sell", these BadWolfQuiz-specific terms
control.

1. Monetizing BadWolfQuiz itself is prohibited without separate written
   permission from the Licensor. This includes, without limitation:

   - charging users specifically for access to a BadWolfQuiz instance;
   - subscriptions or recurring payments for BadWolfQuiz access or features;
   - one-time purchases for BadWolfQuiz access or features;
   - paid tiers, paywalls, paid add-ons, or paid features in BadWolfQuiz;
   - offering BadWolfQuiz itself as a paid hosted or SaaS service;
   - placing advertising, sponsorship, affiliate links, or similar revenue
     mechanisms in or around the BadWolfQuiz interface for the purpose of
     monetizing the BadWolfQuiz instance itself.

2. Notwithstanding the Commons Clause above, commercial use is expressly
   permitted when the money is earned from an activity, product, content,
   event, service, sponsorship, platform, or other offering in which
   BadWolfQuiz is merely used as a tool and BadWolfQuiz itself is not what is
   being sold or monetized.

   Permitted examples include, without limitation:

   - monetized livestreams or videos on YouTube, Twitch, or similar platforms;
   - sponsored broadcasts or other sponsored content;
   - paid productions;
   - competitions, tournaments, or events;
   - paid setup, consulting, training, customization, or support services,
     provided the payment is for the service and not for access to BadWolfQuiz
     or its functionality;
   - other commercial activities whose revenue comes from the surrounding
     content, platform, event, production, sponsorship, service, or activity
     rather than from selling access to BadWolfQuiz itself.

   This exception applies only if users are not charged specifically for
   access to BadWolfQuiz or its functionality, no BadWolfQuiz feature is
   unlocked, improved, or made available in exchange for payment, and
   BadWolfQuiz itself is not offered as a paid hosted or SaaS service.

3. Premium, privileged, contributor, supporter, experimental, or similar
   BadWolfQuiz features are permitted when they are provided without monetary
   payment. Such features may be granted for contributions, achievements,
   recognition, community participation, testing, or other non-monetary
   reasons.

4. Any monetization of BadWolfQuiz itself outside the permissions above
   requires separate written permission or a separate commercial license from
   the Licensor.
